{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなはGWどこに行く～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！107回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nあぷるんさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴールデンウイーク、家族と過ごせる日があったらいいな～(｡・・｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バーベキューしたい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/28/5218487/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀北コンビ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/28/5218487/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青と赤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/28/5218487/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、お仕事が終わってメールみたら\n未央奈から面白いお話が載ってる画像がきてて\n帰り道肩を震わせながら\n帰りました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白くて、でも1人だから\n笑うの我慢してたら\n肩が震えてました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/28/5218487/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、朝4時から\nまいちゅんの ANN0の\n乃木坂モーニングコールコーナーで\nはじまり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事終わるまでの2時間くらいの間で\nまいちゅんと何度もハイタッチを決めて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんではじまり\nまいちゅんでおわった１日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月さんのことを、若さんとか若月さんって\n呼んでたのに\n最近は、若さんのこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テト！！テトちゃん！！！って\n呼びそうになります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若さんのテトちゃんも\nザキのまりいさんも\nひなちまのがんちゃんも\nまいちゅんのくくるも\n慣れてきて、\n本番までの残りの日にちは\n固めていくだけです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ！！！じょしらく弐のビジュアルが解禁されましたね！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかえりきぐちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいまきぐちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年よりも、キャラを掴みにくく\nきぐちゃんをまだ自分の物にしきれてませんが\n私なりのきぐちゃんになれるように！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"末っ子の可愛げがある\nいたずらっ子で真っ黒な中身を\n表現できたらなと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のじょしらく弐は、去年のじょしらくと違い、\n稽古を重ねれば重ねるほど\n感情移入し、楽しかったりびっくりしたり\n切なくなったり、悲しくなったりします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちのじょしらくが皆さんに届くように\n頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/28/5218487/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/28/5218487/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/28/5218487/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/28/5218487/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  ジャスティンボーイさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎乃木恋めっちゃ楽しいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎楽しいですよね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関係が変わっていくのとか\nストーリー読めたりとか！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分がアプリのゲームになるなんて\n思ってなかったな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  三歳のサイさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎眠いときどうやって目覚めさせますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎眠いときは少し仮眠します！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に眠い時って、\n一回寝ないと絶対起きてられない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眠たくって、仮眠した後の\nすっきり感すごいよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、今すぐ寝たいってときに\nベットにはいる幸せ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  ノビカースケさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎まさかのきいちゃんがモーニングコールだったんですか！最高！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎そうだったんです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんにおこしてもらいました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、モーニングコールのモーニングコール！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんありがとう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(428)  いぬ！さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎ANN０LINEつけたら、日奈子ちゃん出てた！偶然！知らなかった(笑)寝起きの電話の声かわいかったよ（〃´ ∇ `）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎寝起きでも声大きいんだ～♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  げすぱさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんは乃木恋で誰を選びました？僕は北野日奈子っていう子を選んでみました！まだ顔なじみって感じですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎やったー！！！うれしいです(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の話はたぶん、1番最初に\nあっしゅんが出てくるよね？！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が誰を選んだのかは\nひみつでーーーす！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"typ